      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(246,243,237,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">No water at your place near Moses Lake or out in the Basin? We repair and replace well pumps across Grant County, with 24/7 emergency service when the tap runs dry.</p>
